    "delta_accuracy_vs_sft / mcnemar_p": "paired accuracy difference vs SFT; exact two-sided McNemar on per-prompt flips",
    "win_rate_vs_sft": "mean over prompts of 1 (judge prefers policy) / 0.5 (TIE) / 0 (prefers SFT); byte-identical policy/SFT responses are a TIE by construction and are never sent to the judge",
